This tool has a name get_favorites
(it be unique), have a description
(this is important for the AI understand what this tool do), the schema
where can ben optional, but if you need some parameters, you need to declare here.
And now the execute
that will receive a function (async or sync) and return in this same format above (with content array, where the object has the type text
and the data).
Here is where I get from zustand the articles added on favorites and parse using JSON.stringify.
Another exemple:
Let's grab the tool to add_favorite
.
